The screen shows LeetCode 121: Best Time to Buy and Sell Stock. Track the lowest earlier price and the best profit from selling today; return zero if no profitable transaction exists.

```javascript
function solve(prices) {
  let minPrice = Infinity;
  let maxProfit = 0;

  for (const price of prices) {
    maxProfit = Math.max(maxProfit, price - minPrice);
    minPrice = Math.min(minPrice, price);
  }

  return maxProfit;
}
```

